 We assembled no common-boundary global physical-stock series for these components and therefore report no physical-stock composite or global decline finding. The SI measurement specification is a specification—not an inventory—with candidate stock, extent, condition, and annual-flow measures and the requirements for comparing them; it contains no endpoint values. Until spatial and temporal boundaries, units, uncertainty, overlap, valuation or normalization, and permitted substitution are specified, these unlike measures should remain a nonadditive vector. SEEA Ecosystem Accounting also reports ecosystem extent and condition separately from ecosystem services and monetary presentations \citep{UN2021SEEA_EA}.
 
